  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">Our Coach Soho Sneaker is inspired by the courageous free spirit of our hometown New York City and built to keep pace with life on the go. Updated in a slender silhouette, our Signature sateen jacquard soft Soho features a lining made with regenerative cotton sourced from farms that use regenerative agricultural practices. The comfortable style is finished with a grooved rubber outsole detailed with a map of Manhattan. Our Signature Sateen Jacquard is made with a blend of 45% recycled polyester and 55% regenerative cotton sourced from farms that use regenerative agricultural practices—those that help to maintain and rejuvenate land, increase biological diversity and soil health, and could lead to increased carbon absorption. It reflects our ongoing commitment to helping reduce our impact on the planet.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Upper Material:</strong> Fabric and man-made leather lining, fabric footbed</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric / Polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Heel / Sole:</strong> Standard</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Official COACH Men Footwear Size Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background: #f8f8f8; border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;\">\n          <th style=\"padding: 6px;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding: 6px;\">Fit / Width</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">US 7</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK 6.5</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Standard (D)</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">US 8</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK 7.5</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Standard (D)</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">US 9</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK 8.5</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Standard (D)</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">US 10</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK 9.5</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Standard (D)</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\"><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">US 11</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK 10.5</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Standard (D)</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">US 12</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">UK 11.5</td><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Standard (D)</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
